      "observed": "STM32L476RGT6 pin 1 (VBAT) is left on an unconnected net with a no-connect flag instead of being tied to the main VCC rail.",
      "expected": "When no external backup battery is used, STM32L4 VBAT should be connected to VDD/VCC per standard practice and the device datasheet.",
